// @FIGURE_CODE_BEGIN
// electrostatic-potential surfaces → large vertex-colored translucent metaball BufferGeometry meshes plus separate red SphereGeometry endpoint ions
// embedded atoms → shaded SphereGeometry meshes for Nu/X red atoms, carbon green-gray atom, and pale substituent atoms
